      "footer_disclaimer": "This document is provided for information purposes. It does not replace a review by a qualified legal professional before final publication.",
      "footer_entity_line": "SHEMEN AGENCY LLC — 30 N Gould St Ste R, Sheridan, WY 82801, USA — contact@shemenagency.com",
      "legal_toc_5": "Illustrative nature of information",
      "legal_a5_h": "Illustrative nature of information and scenarios",
      "legal_a5_b": "<h3>5.1 Value of numerical examples</h3><p>The calculation tables, orders of magnitude, profitability simulations and numerical scenarios shown on the Site's pages are illustrative reconstructions and examples based on observed sector averages.</p><div class=\"encart\">These elements are provided strictly for illustrative and educational purposes to help the User form an impression. They do not, under any circumstances, constitute a contractual commitment of results, a guarantee of revenue or a promise of financial gain.</div><h3>5.2 Offers and pricing</h3><p>Prices shown on the Site are exclusive of tax and are valid as of the date of consultation, subject to update by the Editor. Only the price validated at payment or shown on a contractual quote or purchase order binds the Editor.</p>",
      "cgv_page_title": "Return and Refund Policy — ATELIER",
      "cgv_title": "Return and Refund Policy",
      "cgv_intro": "This document governs every order, sale of services or subscription entered into between ATELIER and a business client. It sets out the cancellation, warranty and refund conditions applicable to each offer, and supplements — without replacing — the written scope specific to each service.",
      "cgv_updated": "Terms of Sale — applicable as of the date of the order.",
